{"product":{"id":9728658276577,"title":"JEFFREY 112","body_html":"<p>The Jeffrey 112 is our powerful soft-snow twin: a 112mm all-mountain freestyle platform built to float, charge, and bring freestyle into deep snow, with enough versatility for the days between storms.</p>\n<p>For 26/27, the Jeffrey 112 receives a new flex profile that adds support and stability without losing the playful feel that defines the Jeffrey Series. Signature Pow Rocker combines lower camber with long rocker lines for smooth float and easy smears, while the longer-radius Bi-Radius Sidecut keeps the ski composed at speed. A wide shovel provides float when the snow gets deep, and Delta Taper makes the tail easier to pivot and release through tight terrain and variable snow. This is the Jeffrey for skiers who want all-mountain range, powder float, and freestyle capability in one platform that stays playful in soft snow and composed at speed.</p>\n<p>Every Jeffrey 112 is built with our custom 2800 hybrid fiberglass/carbon composite, a 100% bamboo core, full-length UHMW sidewalls, and the thickest bases and edges in skiing. The result is a stable, playful, and durable soft-snow twin designed to take the beating that comes with daily use.</p>","vendor":"ON3P","product_type":"Skis","created_at":"2026-09-15T20:18:36-07:00","handle":"jeffrey-112","updated_at":"2026-09-24T12:40:40-07:00","published_at":"2026-09-20T14:30:42-07:00","template_suffix":"ski","published_scope":"global","tags":"26.27, Jeffrey, Stock Ski","variants":[{"id":49128494596321,"product_id":9728658276577,"title":"176cm","price":"899.00","sku":"27ON3PJF112176","position":1,"inventory_policy":"deny","compare_at_price":"","fulfillment_service":"manual","inventory_management":"shopify","option1":"176cm","option2":null,"option3":null,"created_at":"2026-09-15T20:18:36-07:00","updated_at":"2026-09-24T12:40:40-07:00","taxable":true,"barcode":null,"grams":0,"image_id":null,"weight":0,"weight_unit":"lb","inventory_quantity":2,"old_inventory